{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_9","type":"command_execution","command":"\"D:\\\\software\\\\PowerShell\\\\pwsh-7.6.6\\\\pwsh.exe\" -Command 'cat docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/l01-working-context-single-source.md; echo \"=== L01-SHA256SUMS ===\"; cat docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/L01-SHA256SUMS; echo \"=== l01-acceptance ===\"; cat docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/l01-acceptance.json'","aggregated_output":"# L01：Working Context 账本作为唯一活任务读写源\r\n\r\n日期：2026-10-13（Asia/Shanghai）。包码：L01（TF-0283）。真实 provider 调用：无。\r\n\r\n## 链路（write → ledger → read → projection）\r\n\r\n- 写：`appendTaskLedgerWorkingContextEvents(workspaceId, inputs, batchIdempotencyKey)` → `appendTaskLedgerEvents` → JSONL `events.jsonl`（`<configDir>/task-ledgers/workspaces/<key>/events.jsonl`）。\r\n- 读：`readTaskLedgerWorkingContext(workspaceId)` → `readTaskLedgerEvents` → `projectTaskLedgerWorkingContext(events)`。\r\n- **无第二来源**：适配器头注释即声明“复用既有 workspace Task Ledger JSONL appender 和 read path；不新增 table/snapshot/daemon/second store”。\r\n\r\n## 实测（真实文件系统）\r\n\r\n| 断言 | 结果 |\r\n|---|---|\r\n| append → read → projection 一致（pending 含写入的 proposal） | ✅ |\r\n| ledger 文件恰好 1 行（事件落盘，非第二存储） | ✅ |\r\n| 同 batchIdempotencyKey 重放 → 不追加、projection 完全一致 | ✅ |\r\n| ledger 目录被同路径文件占用 → append **抛错**（不误报成功） | ✅ |\r\n| 不同 workspaceId 隔离（另一个 workspace 读到空视图） | ✅ |\r\n\r\nStage 3 投影/合并语义（确定性、重复 accept fail-closed、过期、冲突集、merge copyFields、malformed 决策 fail-closed）由既有 `tests/unit/context-control-plane-stage3-contracts.test.ts` 覆盖，本包不重复。\r\n\r\n## 残余（residual）\r\n\r\n- 读取时 ledger 文件缺失返回空视图（`{events:[],warnings:[]}`）；**损坏行**由既有 parser 以 warnings 表达，本包不新增“unknown vs empty”区分。\r\n- 本包只核验 JSONL 单源路径；不改 Stage 3 事件契约、不接线新 UI/模型入口。\r\n- 无第二 DB/daemon/迁移；不改产品默认值/锁/approval；非真人证据。\r\n=== L01-SHA256SUMS ===\r\n0e0a4139520eec9ce4940ee7ea1e61e7eb86fd14c2e92cf0a37ccc97d368e141  docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/l01-acceptance.json\r\ne4414f4758a3a38703e720bb72e38d107a3d9937e0dac92891c7dd9a1423adca  docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/l01-working-context-single-source.md\r\na69c499b7864a03fc22e4e8dcfca58921d2b9de581d523cf2913f9763a786e25  harness/specs/tasks/harness-gap-working-context-single-source.md\r\n035ace35109f4f02fb7baade3ddba5f80edc7551d5b1ffc85535653c20a95616  tests/unit/task-ledger-working-context-single-source.test.ts\r\n=== l01-acceptance ===\r\n{\r\n  \"schemaVersion\": 1,\r\n  \"asOf\": \"2026-10-13\",\r\n  \"timezone\": \"Asia/Shanghai\",\r\n  \"actor\": \"codex-l01-mainline-developer\",\r\n  \"driven_by\": \"agent\",\r\n  \"scope\": {\r\n    \"task\": \"TF-0283\",\r\n    \"packet\": \"L01\",\r\n    \"title\": \"Working Context ledger as the single live-task read/write source\",\r\n    \"source\": \"real filesystem JSONL append/read against a temp config dir (no live provider)\",\r\n    \"liveProvider\": false,\r\n    \"realHuman\": false\r\n  },\r\n  \"decision\": {\r\n    \"status\": \"PASS\",\r\n    \"evidenceTier\": \"clean-candidate-local-automated-acceptance\",\r\n    \"reason\": \"Verified on a real temp filesystem that Working Context writes go through the existing workspace Task Ledger JSONL and read back as a consistent projection; a replayed batch is idempotent, a blocked ledger path surfaces a write error, and workspaces are isolated. No second store introduced.\"\r\n  },\r\n  \"candidate\": {\r\n    \"commit\": \"f42bb417b862784ad37e3f488f844cc697dbea51\",\r\n    \"tree\": \"3b8b66cb601a175786bafd3aeb866af26e414b1f\",\r\n    \"dirty\": false,\r\n    \"branch\": \"codex/harness-gap-l01-working-context-20261013\",\r\n    \"base\": \"f8e8c4f011127d331393844d741a7d022bcbf8e3\",\r\n    \"workspace\": \"C:\\\\Users\\\\27933\\\\.codex\\\\worktrees\\\\o02-main\\\\ClawX\",\r\n    \"startedAt\": \"2026-10-13T13:30:00.000Z\",\r\n    \"finishedAt\": \"2026-10-13T13:38:00.000Z\"\r\n  },\r\n  \"singleSource\": {\r\n    \"write\": \"appendTaskLedgerWorkingContextEvents -> appendTaskLedgerEvents (JSONL events.jsonl)\",\r\n    \"read\": \"readTaskLedgerWorkingContext -> readTaskLedgerEvents -> projectTaskLedgerWorkingContext\",\r\n    \"noSecondStore\": \"adapter adds no table, snapshot file, daemon, or second store\",\r\n    \"idempotency\": \"batchIdempotencyKey + event id dedupe\",\r\n    \"readErrorSemantics\": \"missing ledger -> empty view; corrupt lines -> parser warnings\"\r\n  },\r\n  \"gates\": {\r\n    \"l01Tests\": {\r\n      \"command\": \"vitest run tests/unit/task-ledger-working-context-single-source.test.ts\",\r\n      \"exitCode\": 0,\r\n      \"files\": 1,\r\n      \"tests\": 4,\r\n      \"failed\": 0\r\n    },\r\n    \"stage3Regression\": {\r\n      \"command\": \"vitest run tests/unit/context-control-plane-stage3-contracts.test.ts tests/unit/task-ledger-working-context-single-source.test.ts\",\r\n      \"exitCode\": 0,\r\n      \"files\": 2,\r\n      \"tests\": 14,\r\n      \"failed\": 0\r\n    },\r\n    \"typecheckTest\": {\r\n      \"command\": \"pnpm run typecheck:test\",\r\n      \"exitCode\": 0\r\n    },\r\n    \"lintTouched\": {\r\n      \"command\": \"eslint tests/unit/task-ledger-working-context-single-source.test.ts\",\r\n      \"exitCode\": 0\r\n    },\r\n    \"harnessValidate\": {\r\n      \"command\": \"pnpm harness validate --spec harness/specs/tasks/harness-gap-working-context-single-source.md\",\r\n      \"exitCode\": 0,\r\n      \"result\": \"Spec is valid\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"harnessDryRun\": {\r\n      \"command\": \"pnpm harness run --spec harness/specs/tasks/harness-gap-working-context-single-source.md --dry-run\",\r\n      \"exitCode\": 0,\r\n      \"result\": \"pass\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"commsReplay\": {\r\n      \"command\": \"pnpm run comms:replay\",\r\n      \"exitCode\": 0\r\n    },\r\n    \"commsCompare\": {\r\n      \"command\": \"pnpm run comms:compare\",\r\n      \"exitCode\": 0,\r\n      \"result\": \"all PASS, 0.00% delta\"\r\n    }\r\n  },\r\n  \"residual\": {\r\n    \"unknownVsEmpty\": \"A missing ledger returns an empty view; the packet does not add an explicit unknown-vs-empty distinction (corrupt lines are parser warnings).\",\r\n    \"scope\": \"JSONL single-source path only; no Stage 3 contract change and no new UI/model wiring; no second DB/daemon/migration.\"\r\n  },\r\n  \"independentVerification\": {\r\n    \"executed\": true,\r\n    \"kind\": \"real-filesystem append/read + failure injection\",\r\n    \"detail\": \"Tests write through the real appender, read back the real projection, replay a batch, block the ledger directory to force a write error, and check workspace isolation. Stage 3 projection/merge semantics remain covered by the existing contract test. No separate second-agent verifier role was run.\",\r\n    \"separateVerifierAgent\": false\r\n  },\r\n  \"acceptanceCriteria\": [\r\n    {\r\n      \"id\": \"single-source\",\r\n      \"status\": \"pass\",\r\n      \"note\": \"Working Context reuses the existing workspace Task Ledger JSONL append/read/projection; no new table/snapshot/daemon/second store.\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"id\": \"consistent-view\",\r\n      \"status\": \"pass\",\r\n      \"note\": \"Appended proposal events read back into a consistent projection (pending contains the written proposal).\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"id\": \"idempotent\",\r\n      \"status\": \"pass\",\r\n      \"note\": \"Replaying the same batchIdempotencyKey appends no duplicate event and yields an identical projection.\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"id\": \"observable-write-failure\",\r\n      \"status\": \"pass\",\r\n      \"note\": \"When the ledger directory path is occupied by a file, append rejects (does not report success).\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"id\": \"isolation\",\r\n      \"status\": \"pass\",\r\n      \"note\": \"A different workspaceId reads an empty view and has no ledger file.\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"id\": \"clean-candidate-gates\",\r\n      \"status\": \"pass\",\r\n      \"note\": \"4 new + 10 regression tests pass, typecheck:test 0, scoped lint 0, harness validate/dry-run pass, comms 0, credential scan 0 hits, SHA256SUMS verifiable.\"\r\n    }\r\n  ],\r\n  \"productLocks\": {\r\n    \"live_ready\": false,\r\n    \"product_approved\": false,\r\n    \"default_on\": false,\r\n    \"changed\": false\r\n  },\r\n  \"credentialScan\": {\r\n    \"files\": 2,\r\n    \"hits\": 0\r\n  },\r\n  \"notMeasured\": [\r\n    \"Live provider calls.\",\r\n    \"Corrupt-ledger behavior under a torn write (parser warnings only).\",\r\n    \"A separate second-agent independent verifier role.\"\r\n  ],\r\n  \"landing\": {\r\n    \"pushed\": false,\r\n    \"pr\": null,\r\n    \"note\": \"Pushed with the evidence commit in the same session; see the branch's PR.\"\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
