equires diff base resolution. Let me try `run --dry-run --no-diff`? The run function calls validate with only `since` and `dryRun`, ignoring noDiff. So it always needs git. I'll report that as environment-limited (no git metadata).\n\nSimilarly comms:replay requires git. Let me check if comms replay/compare can run without git... it calls `git rev-parse --verify HEAD`. No git → fails. Environment-limited.\n\nLet me verify credential scan and SHA readback. Also check `pnpm harness validate` needs deps — harness has no deps (pure node), so `node harness/src/cli.mjs` is the equivalent.\n\nLet me do a credential scan of the deliverables.\n\nAlso should I register the module in runtime-core/index.ts? The reference doesn't (rg found nothing). Keep consistent — don't add.\n\nLet me finalize: clean temp, run credential scan, SHA readback.\n\nAlso I should double-check the module's import path: `../../../shared/types/task-ledger.js`. From `openclaw_runtime/src/runtime-core/` → `../../../` = repo root? Let's count: file at openclaw_runtime/src/runtime-core/x.ts. `../` → src, `../../` → openclaw_runtime, `../../../` → repo root. Then `shared/types/task-ledger.js`. Correct. And the reference used the same path, confirmed since digest matched.\n\nNow credential scan + readback."}}
